name: DNA — single-card duplicator
author: corpus
description: >-
  If the first hand of the round has only 1 card, DNA adds a permanent copy of it to the
  deck and draws it to hand. First-shop duplicator: copy strong cards (Kings, Queens,
  9s, Lucky, Glass) and scale Hologram/Blue Joker.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: DNA
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Hologram
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: BlueJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Cloud9
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
